                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6411/orig.; Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Budapest</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grant-Smith</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-17T20:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                                1921—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 18—6:58
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>355. Hungarian Minister for Foreign Affairs asks <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >agrément</hi> to Count Laszlo Szechenyi as Minister to the United
                    States.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grant-Smith</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
